# Membership changes between consoles of different spans. Console 0 at
# 60000/1001 frames a second paces the scenario and promises one step
# ahead. Consoles 1 and 2 run at 16777216/280896 and 4194304/70224, one
# span at two clock rates, console 3 at 60000/1001 and console 4 at
# 60000/334. Port 0 of consoles 0 and 2 share a cable from frame 0, on a
# bus of up to three ports, and port 1 of consoles 2 and 3 is on Ethernet
# from frame 0. Console 3 leaves Ethernet in its frame 60 and rejoins it in
# its frame 80, with console 2 parked inside a frame each time. Console
# 4's port, cabled to console 3's port 0, detaches in its frame 0 and
# attaches again in its frame 40: a late join whose span is not known yet,
# so console 0 stops short in step 41 and the step runs again.
#
# Console 2 is at its edge to step 31 and parked inside a frame from 32 to
# 295 (the hold moves its edges off console 1's), console 1 parked from 101
# to 281 once cabled and at its edge from 282, and console 4 parked from
# 104. So the plug at 100 meets console 2 inside a frame and leaves console
# 1 parked, the save at 100 holds the join of consoles 1 and 2 before
# console 2's edge makes it, and the uncable at 285 pulls console 1 at its
# edge with console 2 parked. The check pins these at the checkpoints
# in_flight, left, back, plugged and pull. An expect on a parked console
# reads its RAM through the memory map (addr 268435456 + offset). Sends
# start at each console's frame 20, so console 2's buses are idle at the
# hold.
console 0 core=test
console 1 core=test
console 2 core=test
console 3 core=test
console 4 core=test
option 0 link_test_fps 60000/1001
option 0 link_test_rate_0 60000
option 0 link_test_lookahead_0 1
option 0 link_test_max_ports_0 3
option 0 link_test_send_frames 20-999999
option 1 link_test_fps 16777216/280896
option 1 link_test_rate_0 16777216
option 1 link_test_max_ports_0 3
option 1 link_test_save_in_advance on
option 1 link_test_send_frames 20-999999
option 2 link_test_ports 2
option 2 link_test_fps 4194304/70224
option 2 link_test_rate_0 4194304
option 2 link_test_rate_1 4194304
option 2 link_test_max_ports_0 3
option 2 link_test_protocol_1 ethernet
option 2 link_test_shared_1 on
option 2 link_test_save_in_advance on
option 2 link_test_send_frames 20-999999
option 3 link_test_ports 2
option 3 link_test_fps 60000/1001
option 3 link_test_rate_0 60000
option 3 link_test_rate_1 60000
option 3 link_test_protocol_1 ethernet
option 3 link_test_shared_1 on
option 3 link_test_detach_1 60
option 3 link_test_reattach_1 80
option 3 link_test_save_in_advance on
option 3 link_test_send_frames 20-999999
option 4 link_test_fps 60000/334
option 4 link_test_rate_0 60000
option 4 link_test_detach_0 0
option 4 link_test_reattach_0 40
option 4 link_test_save_in_advance on
option 4 link_test_send_frames 20-999999
